OL,3,GNEWSAPlans submitted for city centre
OL,4,Aco-living scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of new homes could be created in
OL,7,FSunderland city centre as part of plans
OL,8,Fto convert a prominent building into a
OL,9,F"co-living" scheme.
OL,11,FNova Co-Living is seeking to redevelop
OL,12,Fand restore Arngrove House on the
OL,13,Fcorner of Frederick Street and St
OL,14,FThomas Street to create new residential
OL,15,Faccommodation.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
