OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlans submitted for city centre
OL,4,Aco-living scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf approved by Sunderland City Council,
OL,7,Fthe site would offer 63 studio suites
OL,8,Feach with a private bathroom and
OL,9,Fkitchenette, along with a communal
OL,10,Flounge and other shared spaces
OL,11,Fincluding a games room and rooftop
OL,12,Fterrace.
OL,14,FThe applicants said the development
OL,15,Fwould be aimed at young professionals,
OL,16,Fgraduates and contract workers seeking
OL,17,F"flexible city-centre living".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
